{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/9f31c02d8fca9fc0008f65644fbf76ee.poster.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/9f31c02d8fca9fc0008f65644fbf76ee.webm?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/9f31c02d8fca9fc0008f65644fbf76ee.mp4?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot; That\u2019s why I\u2019m here\u2014to smash it all.<br><br>Till not even a speck of dust is left. &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>In an age when humanity gave up on happiness\u2014just to escape unhappiness\u2014and became nothing but bugs.  <br>This is the tale of a witch who grips her baseball bat tight... and smashes everything in her path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/250abc5a35239941c263491be30d2f7d.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;KILL THE WITCH&quot; is a hardcore 2D pixel action platformer.  <br>Here, you fight with nothing but your own skill\u2014and the will that drives you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/bef66eb78e7b675afcb9c39783ef7ba2.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore gameplay to satisfy your thirst for challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of unique, unforgettable characters ready to steal your heart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original pixel art and soundtrack that will captivate your eyes and ears.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds in a mostly linear structure of stages and boss fights, built around three core actions\u2014move, jump, and roll\u2014 and two signature mechanics: Home Run and Transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath its intuitive and minimalistic controls lies a game that truly earns its <i>hardcore</i> label\u2014with <strong>punishing difficulty</strong> and a <strong>narrative that refuses to go easy on you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/a1132633e6efa4bc8a6061df3b4b25e4.poster.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/a1132633e6efa4bc8a6061df3b4b25e4.webm?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/a1132633e6efa4bc8a6061df3b4b25e4.mp4?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Countless dangers lie in wait along your path\u2014<br>each one determined to bring you down and make you kneel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/af75bb03a6bda01f7b6f98637256f9f2.poster.avif?t=1763478666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/af75bb03a6bda01f7b6f98637256f9f2.webm?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/af75bb03a6bda01f7b6f98637256f9f2.mp4?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you fall here and surrender?<br><br>Or take one more step\u2014toward misfortune itself?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/3d02e7a96ac3a9b7b5972e7a96ef4252.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game draws inspiration from many titles I love\u2014<br>OFF, Cave Story, Momodora, and Touhou Project, to name a few.<br><br>But at the same time, I believe it carries something of my own.<br>Something I needed to express.<br><br>Thank you, always.<br>I truly hope you enjoy the game. :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/f3049429874730840b2f361e10bf6dac.avif?t=1763478666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras_big/f3049429874730840b2f361e10bf6dac.avif?t=1763478666 width=800 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director : ASO<br>Develop : ASO, HongRyeol <br>Art : ASO, Kong Ji Hyeon<br>Soundtrack : Misty</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2878760?t=1763478666","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763478666","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/55f4eb5970b7de4e5e06f44d4f112628ca4be000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763478666","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/55f4eb5970b7de4e5e06f44d4f112628ca4be000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763478666","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2879290,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Guide to creating and streaming game content</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to stream it, post it on YouTube~!<br><br>If you have any other requests or questions, please feel free to contact us :)<br><a href=\"mailto:boss@snakeeagle.com\">boss@snakeeagle.com</a></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/9f31c02d8fca9fc0008f65644fbf76ee.poster.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/9f31c02d8fca9fc0008f65644fbf76ee.webm?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/9f31c02d8fca9fc0008f65644fbf76ee.mp4?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>&quot; That\u2019s why I\u2019m here\u2014to smash it all.<br><br>Till not even a speck of dust is left. &quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br>In an age when humanity gave up on happiness\u2014just to escape unhappiness\u2014and became nothing but bugs.  <br>This is the tale of a witch who grips her baseball bat tight... and smashes everything in her path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/250abc5a35239941c263491be30d2f7d.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;KILL THE WITCH&quot; is a hardcore 2D pixel action platformer.  <br>Here, you fight with nothing but your own skill\u2014and the will that drives you forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/bef66eb78e7b675afcb9c39783ef7ba2.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore gameplay to satisfy your thirst for challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cast of unique, unforgettable characters ready to steal your heart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original pixel art and soundtrack that will captivate your eyes and ears.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game unfolds in a mostly linear structure of stages and boss fights, built around three core actions\u2014move, jump, and roll\u2014 and two signature mechanics: Home Run and Transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath its intuitive and minimalistic controls lies a game that truly earns its <i>hardcore</i> label\u2014with <strong>punishing difficulty</strong> and a <strong>narrative that refuses to go easy on you</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/a1132633e6efa4bc8a6061df3b4b25e4.poster.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/a1132633e6efa4bc8a6061df3b4b25e4.webm?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/a1132633e6efa4bc8a6061df3b4b25e4.mp4?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Countless dangers lie in wait along your path\u2014<br>each one determined to bring you down and make you kneel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/af75bb03a6bda01f7b6f98637256f9f2.poster.avif?t=1763478666\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/af75bb03a6bda01f7b6f98637256f9f2.webm?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/af75bb03a6bda01f7b6f98637256f9f2.mp4?t=1763478666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Will you fall here and surrender?<br><br>Or take one more step\u2014toward misfortune itself?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/3d02e7a96ac3a9b7b5972e7a96ef4252.avif?t=1763478666\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game draws inspiration from many titles I love\u2014<br>OFF, Cave Story, Momodora, and Touhou Project, to name a few.<br><br>But at the same time, I believe it carries something of my own.<br>Something I needed to express.<br><br>Thank you, always.<br>I truly hope you enjoy the game. :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras/f3049429874730840b2f361e10bf6dac.avif?t=1763478666\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/extras_big/f3049429874730840b2f361e10bf6dac.avif?t=1763478666 width=800 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Director : ASO<br>Develop : ASO, HongRyeol <br>Art : ASO, Kong Ji Hyeon<br>Soundtrack : Misty</p>","developers":["SnakeEagle"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2878760/header.jpg?t=1763478666","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2878760/843946/278fac6c8297fb599de432c87129e7aadd7983bf/1750949990/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741073841","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2878760/843946/278fac6c8297fb599de432c87129e7aadd7983bf/1750949990/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741073841","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2878760/843946/278fac6c8297fb599de432c87129e7aadd7983bf/1750949990/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1741073841","id":257109580,"name":"DEMO_Trailer_2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257109580/9784bd8a4559a673e3520d7e07c85cc7a2018c7d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741073841"}],"name":"KILL THE WITCH","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 